WEBVTT

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:32.970
and broke the Gothic Line.

00:13:32.970 --> 00:13:35.258
A six-month stalemate

00:13:35.258 --> 00:13:37.463
was broken by the 442nd

00:13:37.463 --> 00:13:40.444
in 32 minutes.

00:13:40.444 --> 00:13:44.080
It was an amazing act,

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:46.930
and when the war ended,

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:50.147
the 442nd returned to the United States

00:13:50.147 --> 00:13:52.563
as the most decorated unit

00:13:52.563 --> 00:13:55.480
of the entire Second World War.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:58.210
They were greeted back on the White House Lawn

00:13:58.210 --> 00:14:00.816
by President Truman, who said to them,